@startuml diqa-checkpoint-selection
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title DIQA Checkpoint Selection Algorithm\nWeighted SRCC + ECE Scoring

' ============================================================================
' ACTIVITY DIAGRAM: Checkpoint Selection Flow
' ============================================================================

start

:Collect all checkpoints
from training run;

:Identify best SRCC value
for specialty dimension;

note right
  **Specialty by Model:**
  - MUSIQ: srcc_sharpness
  - QualiCLIP: srcc_color
  - InternVL3: srcc_overall
  - DocIQ/Qwen: srcc_mean
end note

:Load preset configuration;

partition "Preset: balanced (default)" {
  :srcc_weight = 0.7
  ece_weight = 0.3
  srcc_band = 0.02;
}

:For each checkpoint...;

repeat
  :Get checkpoint SRCC and ECE values;

  if (SRCC < best_srcc - srcc_band?) then (yes)
    :score = -infinity
    (excluded);
  else (no)
    :Normalize SRCC within band
    srcc_norm = (srcc - band_floor) / band_width;

    note right
      band_floor = best_srcc - 0.02
      band_width = 0.02

      Example: best=0.85, band_floor=0.83
      - srcc=0.85 -> norm=1.0
      - srcc=0.84 -> norm=0.5
      - srcc=0.83 -> norm=0.0
    end note

    :Normalize ECE (inverted)
    ece_norm = max(0, min(1, 1 - ece/0.15));

    note right
      ECE range assumed [0, 0.15]
      - ece=0.00 -> norm=1.0
      - ece=0.08 -> norm=0.47
      - ece=0.15 -> norm=0.0
    end note

    :Compute weighted score
    score = 0.7 * srcc_norm + 0.3 * ece_norm;
  endif

repeat while (more checkpoints?) is (yes)
-> no;

:Sort checkpoints by score (descending);

:Select checkpoint with highest score;

:Return best checkpoint;

stop

' ============================================================================
' EXAMPLE CALCULATIONS
' ============================================================================

legend bottom
  **Example: Selecting Best Checkpoint (best_srcc = 0.85)**

  | Checkpoint | SRCC | ECE | SRCC Norm | ECE Norm | Score | Status |
  | A | 0.85 | 0.08 | 1.00 | 0.47 | **0.84** | Winner |
  | B | 0.84 | 0.04 | 0.50 | 0.73 | 0.57 | |
  | C | 0.84 | 0.02 | 0.50 | 0.87 | 0.61 | |
  | D | 0.83 | 0.01 | 0.00 | 0.93 | 0.28 | |
  | E | 0.82 | 0.01 | -inf | - | excluded | Outside band |

  **Trade-off Analysis:**
  - A wins despite worse ECE because SRCC dominates (70%)
  - If ECE weight increased to 50%: C would win (score=0.69 vs A=0.74)
  - Band prevents selecting E even with perfect ECE
endlegend

note right
  **Source:**
  - src/.../labeling/arena/runner.py
  - src/.../labeling/arena/metrics.py
  - src/.../labeling/arena/schemas.py

  **Documentation:**
